    "etsyDescription": "Caught in a moment of fiery determination, Entei bursts into action with an energy that’s palpable. This isn’t just a shirt; it’s a tribute to nostalgia and the vivid adventures of our favorite Pokémon.\n\nThe vibrant back design captures Entei in all his glory — flames dancing around him as he races forward, embodying strength and confidence from the beloved 90s era. Made for those who resonate with his fierce spirit, this unisex cotton tee is not just clothing; it’s a slice of art you can wear. Available from sizes S to 3XL, it offers ultimate comfort besides being cool on the streets.\n\nGift it to your best friend who never misses out on Pokémon trivia nights or rock it yourself at conventions where fellow fans will get your vibe instantly! The fun design pairs effortlessly with jeans or joggers, making it versatile enough for casual outings.\n\nMachine wash cold, tumble dry low. Made to order — ships in 3-5 business days.",
