    "etsyDescription": "When Arcanine bounds into action, you know that fiery spirit is ready to ignite the day! This Arcanine Back Print Shirt captures that beloved Pokemon's fierce loyalty and playful nature in a way that truly stands out.\n\nImagine sporting a tee that showcases Arcanine in all its glory with a large back design — it's like carrying a piece of the Pokemon adventure wherever you go. The vivid detailing reflects its power and charm, perfect for those who understand what it means to be both fearless and fun-loving.\n\nMade from 100% cotton with direct-to-garment (DTG) premium print technology, this unisex fit t-shirt comes in sizes S-3XL to ensure comfort for everyone. Whether you're heading out with friends or binge-watching your favorite anime, you'll feel as vibrant as the fire-type hero featured on your back.\n\nThis shirt makes an unforgettable gift for Pokemon enthusiasts or anyone who needs a touch of nostalgia in their wardrobe. Ideal for birthdays, holidays, or just because—they’ll appreciate your thoughtful choice!\n\nMachine wash cold, tumble dry low.\nMade to order — ships in 3-5 business days.",
